# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local reference clone of openai/codex (vendoring source, never committed)
/codex/

# sctxx local artifacts and host-mode runs
.sctxx/
CLAUDE.local.md

# website build output and dependencies
website/node_modules/
website/dist/

# npm packaging output
#
# The platform packages are empty shells in git: the release workflow drops the
# built binary, LICENSE, and NOTICE into them before publishing. Committing the
# binaries would put a fresh 2.6 MB copy in every release commit, and the
# licence copies would drift from the files they duplicate.
/npm/sctxx-*/bin/
/npm/sctxx-*/LICENSE
/npm/sctxx-*/NOTICE
/npm/sctxx/LICENSE
/npm/sctxx/NOTICE
**/*.tgz

# release build output (the workflow assembles tarballs here)
/dist/
